    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1292">

                <pb facs="0884" n="768" xml:id="pg768"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 812.00/10476.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Vice Consul Guyant to
                        the Secretary of State.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Consulate</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Ensenada</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1914-01-08">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">January 8, 1914</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>American and Chinese merchants have asked my advice relative to expected attempt
                    to collect more money from local firms for soldiers. Shall I advise them to
                    refuse pay?</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Guyant</hi></signed>.</closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
